[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Platform Integration Requirements
UID: GSSC-PLATFORM-INTEGRATION-REQUIREMENTS
VERSION: 5.0.0

[GRAMMAR]
ELEMENTS:
- TAG: TEXT
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: SECTION
  PROPERTIES:
    IS_COMPOSITE: True
    PREFIX: None
    VIEW_STYLE: Narrative
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: REQUIREMENT
  PROPERTIES:
    PREFIX: GSSC-PIR-
    VIEW_STYLE: Table
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: RATIONALE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: COMMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: DERIVED
    TYPE: SingleChoice(True, False)
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: CHANGE_DRIVER
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: REVIEW_STATUS
    TYPE: SingleChoice(Changed, Approved, Baselined)
    REQUIRED: True
  RELATIONS:
  - TYPE: Parent
    ROLE: Satisfies
    REVERSE_ROLE: Satisfied By

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PIR-INTRODUCTION
TITLE: Introduction

[TEXT]
UID: GSSC-PIR-INTRO-PURPOSE
STATEMENT: >>>
These Platform Integration Requirements allocate the GSSC Website objectives to the Public Frontend, the Member Frontend, and the Unified Backend. Each requirement states a behavior of one of those parts and satisfies the objectives that call for that behavior.
<<<

[TEXT]
UID: GSSC-PIR-INTRO-PUBLIC
STATEMENT: >>>
The Public Frontend is the publicly accessible application on the public-facing primary domain. It presents the public pages and announcements, and it provides access to the Member Frontend on the members-only subdomain.
<<<

[TEXT]
UID: GSSC-PIR-INTRO-MEMBER
STATEMENT: >>>
The Member Frontend is that members-only subdomain. A member logs in before accessing its contents. Its home page is a dashboard. Members manage their accounts, elections, publications, announcements, newsletters, events, and the member directory. Members with the necessary permissions modify public pages and the sections of those pages.
<<<

[TEXT]
UID: GSSC-PIR-INTRO-BACKEND
STATEMENT: >>>
The Unified Backend supports the public and members-only spaces. It provides public contents upon request, provides member-only contents upon request from members, accepts modification by members with the necessary permissions, and protects visitor and member information and the integrity of published content.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

