[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PIR-MEMBER-PAGE-EDITING
TITLE: Public Page Editing

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PIR-20
TITLE: Member Page Modifications
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL let members with the necessary permissions modify public pages and the sections therein, including publications, without programming knowledge.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-9
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-OBJ-7
  ROLE: Satisfies
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-OBJ-5
  ROLE: Satisfies
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-OBJ-4
  ROLE: Satisfies

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PIR-22
TITLE: Simultaneous Editing
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Member Frontend SHALL let members with the necessary permissions modify different public pages and the sections therein, including publications, at the same time, and SHALL limit modification of a given public page or section to one user at a time.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The website does not resolve editing conflicts. One user at a time on a public page or section prevents lost changes, while other members with the necessary permissions can still modify other public pages or sections.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-9
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-OBJ-6
  ROLE: Satisfies

[[/SECTION]]

