UID: GSSC-PIR-47
TITLE: Credential Storage
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL authenticate members using retained hashes of their passwords, and SHALL hold other keys outside the Unified Backend.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The backend retains a hash of a password and uses that hash to authenticate the member. The password itself is not retained. Other keys are held outside the Unified Backend. This requirement does not set the hash method.
<<<
