[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PIR-53
TITLE: Simultaneous Page Editing
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let members with the necessary permissions modify different public pages and the sections therein, including publications, at the same time, and SHALL limit modification of a given public page or section to one user at a time.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The website does not resolve editing conflicts. One user at a time on a public page or section prevents lost changes, while other members with the necessary permissions can still modify other public pages or sections.
<<<
